   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "In this game, the only way\nforward is to kill your\nfriend May.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.121,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Again, and again.",
   "start": 4.371,
   "duration": 1.691,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "May, Be Dead. A\nfirst-person walk through\nendless hexagonal rooms of\nmemory.",
   "start": 8.312,
   "duration": 5.688,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The rooms borrow from\ntheatre, film, literature\nand architecture.",
   "start": 14.25,
   "duration": 3.781,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The demo is about seven\nhundred megabytes, for\nWindows and Mac, in\nEnglish and Simplified\nChinese.",
   "start": 18.281,
   "duration": 5.636,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The full game has four\nchapters, due in December.",
